OL,4,B84 days, four titles, one historic     
OL,5,Bfeat - Alcaraz's remarkable return     
OL,6,GThe men's tennis season ended as it    
OL,7,Gbegan, with a beaming Carlos Alcaraz   
OL,8,Gholding aloft one of the sport's       
OL,9,Gbiggest trophies.                      
OL,11,FIn January, he won the Australian Open 
OL,12,Fto complete the career Grand Slam. Ten 
OL,13,Fmonths later, he stood as the victor   
OL,14,Fin Turin, having ended his wait for a  
OL,15,Ffirst ATP Finals title.                
OL,17,FWatching Alcaraz over recent weeks, it 
OL,18,Fwould be easy to forget that for a     
OL,19,Ffour-month period this year, the 23-   
OL,20,Fyear-old barely picked up a racquet.   
